@description EA Native Automation
@version 2.2.4
@author Ebin Augustin
@about
  Compact Pro Tools-inspired automation panel for REAPER audio post-production.
  Windows x64 native JUCE extension with a bundled Lua engine. Restart REAPER after installation.
  Run EA: Native Automation (JUCE) - toggle panel. Search EA: Automation to assign shortcuts.
  Includes Preview/Capture, Manual Write, Write on Stop, copy/paste/fill, adaptive docking and themes.
  Known issues: native track volume/pan Manual Write and envelope lane visibility still require live host confirmation.
  macOS/Linux source only; no installable binaries for those platforms yet.
  AGPL-3.0-or-later. Complete corresponding source and dependency archives are linked below.
@links
